## Common Issues & Solutions

### Issue 1: "RuntimeError: CUDA out of memory"
```python
# Solution: Reduce batch size
trainer.train(
    batch=8,  # Instead of 16
    imgsz=512  # Instead of 640 if still OOM
)
```

### Issue 2: "No labels found"
```bash
# Check label files exist
ls data/labels/train/
ls data/labels/val/

# Verify data.yaml paths are correct
cat data.yaml

# Make sure label format is correct (YOLO format)
cat data/labels/train/img001.txt
```

### Issue 3: Model not learning (mAP stays at 0)
```python
# Check class IDs in labels (should be 0, 1, 2)
# Verify normalized coordinates (all values 0.0-1.0)
# Try reducing learning rate
trainer.train(lr0=0.001)  # Instead of default 0.01
```

### Issue 4: Training is too slow
```python
# Use smaller model
trainer = SpeedSignTrainer(model_size='n')

# Reduce image size
trainer.train(imgsz=416)

# Or train on fewer images first
trainer.train(fraction=0.5)  # Use 50% of data
```

### Issue 5: Overfitting (train mAP >> val mAP)
```python
# Increase augmentation
trainer.train(
    mosaic=1.0,
    mixup=0.2,
    degrees=20.0,
    hsv_s=0.9
)

# Add more validation data
# Reduce model size
# Enable dropout
```

